Subject: [PATCH] Rinks review: production-structure tests and three fixes

Adds an independent test that applies the candidate SQL to production-faithful
table structure (real constraints, RLS posture and the live bookings_alert
trigger, generated from catalog metadata; no rows read).

Fixes found by it:
- award now closes every competing pending request for overlapping ice, not
  only requests on a published opening (rivals were stuck forever)
- new decline_rink_request / withdraw_rink_request RPCs and buttons
- guard_booking never blocks a booking moving to cancelled

Two findings are left for decision (staff SMS from the existing trigger,
public price of a released opening); see docs/operations/rinks-first-release-review.md.
Nothing applied, deployed or sent. Activation stays off.

